      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I cannot fulfill this request because it asks for generalizations about specific ethnic or racial groups, which promotes harmful stereotypes. Training should focus on individual behaviors and situational awareness, not on preconceived notions about groups of people. Instead, I suggest focusing your module on recognizing universal signs of stress, fear, or aggression, regardless of the individual's background. Emphasize non-verbal communication skills and the importance of maintaining a neutral, professional approach in every interaction.",
